{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the ultimate drift racing sensation in Drift Legends 2, the second installment of the incredibly realistic 3D drifting game. Take control of highly-detailed legendary drift cars and conquer various tracks as you strive to break records. Test your skills in a multiplayer game mode, if you think you are tough enough. Challenge other drivers and ascend to the pinnacle of the online leaderboard. Progress from a novice to a professional drift driver. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Realistic physics, simulating every aspect of car behavior;<br>- Drive more than 50 powerful and exciting, highly detailed drifting cars;<br>- Drift on detailed tracks with different layouts;<br>- Career mode allows you to get more experience, complete achievements and unlock powerful secret cars;<br>- Every car behaves differently. Feel the power and weight, find your balance;<br>- Customize your cars with exclusive paintjobs, rims, tires and plates;<br>- Real engine sounds for every car;<br>- Turbocharger, gearbox and tires sounds;<br>- Realistic 3D graphics;<br>- Online drift multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're a car enthusiast, this game is definitely for you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664010?t=1747294968","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664010?t=1747294968","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664010/8aa2f39ddd080d35ab40bc5541078780cde5c1a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747294968","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664010/8aa2f39ddd080d35ab40bc5541078780cde5c1a3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747294968","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the ultimate drift racing sensation in Drift Legends 2, the second installment of the incredibly realistic 3D drifting game. Take control of highly-detailed legendary drift cars and conquer various tracks as you strive to break records. Test your skills in a multiplayer game mode, if you think you are tough enough. Challenge other drivers and ascend to the pinnacle of the online leaderboard. Progress from a novice to a professional drift driver. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Realistic physics, simulating every aspect of car behavior;<br>- Drive more than 50 powerful and exciting, highly detailed drifting cars;<br>- Drift on detailed tracks with different layouts;<br>- Career mode allows you to get more experience, complete achievements and unlock powerful secret cars;<br>- Every car behaves differently. Feel the power and weight, find your balance;<br>- Customize your cars with exclusive paintjobs, rims, tires and plates;<br>- Real engine sounds for every car;<br>- Turbocharger, gearbox and tires sounds;<br>- Realistic 3D graphics;<br>- Online drift multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're a car enthusiast, this game is definitely for you!</p>","developers":["Black Fox Entertainment"],"dlc":[3681930,3707410,3707420,3707430,3707440,3707450,3707460],"genres":[{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664010/07fe8c242fc8b3189381bb04d06bdfb752687d10/header.jpg?t=1747294968","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS: